----- stdout -----
Read bundled Pina reference documentation in the terminal.

Run without TOPIC to list every bundled topic. Set `PINA_TEMPLATES_DIR` to a directory containing `<topic>.t.md` files to override or add topics.

Usage: pina docs [TOPIC]

Arguments:
  [TOPIC]
          Topic to render. Omit to list bundled topics

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Examples:
  pina docs
  pina docs pina-overview
  pina docs pina-idl
  PINA_TEMPLATES_DIR=./templates pina docs team-conventions

